has been indicted a second time, this time&nbsp;
federally. He will be arrested and booked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:19.920
on Tuesday in Miami at 3 p.m. Eastern Time.&nbsp;
Ladies and gentlemen, it is happening and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.080
it is even more unprecedented. If you can&nbsp;
if you could even say such a such a thing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

