Wow, what a day. What a night. CNBC Report&nbsp;
ex-President's Arraignment comes day before his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:40.980
birthday. Donald Trump has become the first U.S.&nbsp;
president, former or otherwise, to be indicted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:47.580
on federal criminal charges. Trump announced on&nbsp;
Thursday night posts on his truth social platform&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:54.900
that prosecutors notified his attorneys. He had&nbsp;
been indicted, NBC News confirmed soon after that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.440 --> 00:01:04.500
