statements, conspiracy to obstruct, according to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:11.400
Trump's own lawyer, James Trusty. The charges&nbsp;
also include willfully retaining documents in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:18.480
