Trump says he's innocent and ripped the case as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:46.980
hoax. It is very important to understand a number&nbsp;
of distinctions between this and what is happening&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:56.520
with the indictment and arrest in New York. The&nbsp;
New York arrest is on state charges. This is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:03.660
a federal indictment. This is not necessarily&nbsp;
the only federal indictment that Donald Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:09.780
is facing because this is only related to the&nbsp;
documents. There is also a federal investigation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:20.640
going on into Donald Trump's role in inciting&nbsp;
the Trump riots of January six, 2021. No charging&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:27.180
decision has been made there, and at minimum,&nbsp;
there are additional state charges possible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:33.000
